
WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Welcome to Ward 42 Fix-It.
Learn how to report a community service problem.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
On the Home page, select "Submit a Report".

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Choose the problem category, such as
a pothole, water leak or broken streetlight.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Enter the street name or nearby landmark.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Describe the problem clearly.
You can also attach a photograph.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Enter your name and cellphone number.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Select "Submit Report" to send the information.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Keep your unique report reference number.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Use "Check Status" to track
the progress of your report.
